WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 23 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:11.220
This is a massive mistake. Beatrix and Lucian just hit those exact same rune holes.

2
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.940
It's got to be their leftover energy, right?

3
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.700
I knew it! I knew my instincts didn't fail me.

4
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.020
Aris, you have the heart of a true dragon knight!

5
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.420
What the hell? Three runes?

6
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.660
The Gutterrat qualifies for the four orders?

7
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.980
Duke Belmont, wait. This can't be real. This isn't me.

8
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.740
Melana, put your hand on the Kodec and swear to me.

9
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.980
Can the Astrolect be tainted by the ones who came before?

10
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.660
Does the crystal ever lie?

11
00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.660
The Resonance Astralum...

12
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.220
...only answers to the blood freshly offered.

13
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.500
This is ridiculous!

14
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.820
How can a piece of trash like him surpass me?!

15
00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.180
Don't sweat it, Bay.

16
00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:54.940
Sure, having three elements lets him pull off a few neat tricks.

17
00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:56.940
But it's still just three.

18
00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.660
He's not in our league. He is nothing.

19
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.100
Look! It's not stopping!

20
00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.420
More energy is pouring out!

21
00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:10.100
Headmaster Thorne swore I'd never become a dragon knight.

22
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:14.060
He looked me in the eye and said my blood was literal poison to dragons.

23
00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:15.420
So...

24
00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:18.100
How is it resonating with so many elements?

25
00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:21.020
Did he lie to me this whole time?
